    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/meaning-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/crosses, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Returns TRUE if this geometric object 'spatially crosses' anotherGeometry: the intersection results in a geometry of dimension one less than the maximum dimension of the two source geometries, and the intersection set is interior to both.\"",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "The keyword ST_Crosses becomes an altLabel of the activity type; the sources defining the operation move to the activity type: OGC 06-103r4 Simple Feature Access - Part 1: Common Architecture, \u00a76.1.17; ISO/IEC 13249-3:2016 Information technology -- Database languages -- SQL multimedia and application packages -- Part 3: Spatial, \u00a75.1.12 ST_Crosses; the illustration of the operation moves to the activity type.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/representation-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/geometry1 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}); inputs/geometry2 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}).",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/tools-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Decision D4: 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/geometry1: GML; inputs/geometry2: GML); description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Corrects what https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses"
    },
