      "affectedProperty": "https://w3id.org/ogc/rim/objectIdentifier",
      "description": "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/crosses to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/crosses/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes.",
